# warnings

## INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT

```text
[INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT] foo.js is dynamically imported by entry.js but also statically imported by entry.js, dynamic import will not move module into another chunk.

```

# Assets

## entry.js

```js
import assert from "node:assert";

// HIDDEN [\0rolldown/runtime.js]
// foo.js
var foo_exports = /* @__PURE__ */ __exportAll({ bar: () => 123 });

// entry.js
Promise.resolve().then(() => foo_exports).then(({ bar: b }) => {
	assert.strictEqual(b, 123);
	assert.strictEqual(123, 123);
});

```

